                                                "sense_id": "8288527d-f798-39c8-b680-ab7c6319f851",
                                                "text": "Similarly, the biotech giant Cargill has begun manufacturing a polymer from vegetable oils that is used in polyurethane foams, which is found in beddings, furniture and car-seat headrests."
                                            },
